ed(O, 'and make it one law with the rest.[^proof]', 'and make it one with the rest.[^proof]')
ed(O, 'The law shows what anything that wants to go on depends on', 'The theorems show what anything that wants to go on depends on')
ed(O, 'What it does not show is that others count too', 'What they do not show is that others count too')
ed(O, 'Whether the law takes this step for us too, and how far, is our first open question.', 'Whether the dynamics take this step for us too, and how far, is our first open question.')
ed(O, 'Where they agree most is the one step the law has not yet taken for us:', 'Where they agree most is that one step, which no theorem here yet takes for us:')
ed(O, 'This law, with that one step to say whose losses count', 'These theorems, with that one step to say whose losses count')
ed(O, 'ranks as it does, is what I offer, for life, as a way of seeing', 'ranks as it does, are what I offer, for life, as a way of seeing')
